    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "yeah. that's exactly it. a faint echo. and honestly, if it's all just going to fade away anyway, it feels like there's no real harm in just... letting it happen. like, if i'm already a ghost, why keep fighting to stay visible? it almost seems easier to just lean into the silence.",
